      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    income = 75000\n    first_bracket_limit = 20000\n    second_bracket_limit = 50000\n    first_rate = 0.10\n    second_rate = 0.15\n    third_rate = 0.20\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    first_bracket_tax = first_bracket_limit * first_rate\n    second_bracket_tax = (second_bracket_limit - first_bracket_limit) * second_rate\n    third_bracket_tax = (income - second_bracket_limit) * third_rate\n    total_tax = first_bracket_tax + second_bracket_tax + third_bracket_tax\n\n    # Return answer rounded to the nearest dollar\n    return round(total_tax)\n```",
